>> usedMemory1 := 0.
>> usedMemory2 := 0.
>> usedMemory3 := 0.
>> usedMemory4 := 0.

Programu usimamizi-wa-kumbukumbu: 0.

{
Muda wakati.
Muda subiri: 1.
Towe andika: Programu idadi-ya-hoja, mstari-mpya.
Programu hoja: 0.
Nambari random.
Towe andika: (Programu mfumo: ['echo 'Hello'']).
} anza.

Programu safisha.
usedMemory1 := (Programu kumbukumbu ? 0).

